ype":"*","children":["A copy of resolutions 14 to 18 passed at the AGM will shortly be submitted to the National Storage Mechanism and will be available for inspection at https://data.fca.org.uk/#/nsm/nationalstoragemechanism."]},{"type":"*","children":["These poll results will be available shortly on the Investors section of the Company’s website at https://www.procookgroup.co.uk/investors/rns. "]}]},{"type":"p","children":["For more information, please contact:"]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ProCook Group plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["Lee Tappenden, Chief Executive Officer"]},{"type":"p","children":["Dan Walden, Chief Financial Officer"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["investor.relations@procook.co.uk"]}]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["MHP (Financial PR Adviser)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Katie Hunt"]},{"type":"p","children":["Lucy Gibbs"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["procook@mhpgroup.com"]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 (0)7885 447 944"]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Notes to editors:"]},{"type":"p","children":["ProCook is the UK's leading direct-to-consumer specialist kitchenware brand. ProCook designs, develops, and retails a high-quality range of direct-sourced and own-brand kitchenware which provides customers with significant value for money."]},{"type":"p","children":["The brand sells directly through its website, www.procook.co.uk, and through 80 own-brand retail stores, located across the UK."]},{"type":"p","children":["Founded over 30 years ago as a family business, selling cookware sets by direct mail in the UK, ProCook has grown into a market leading, multi-channel specialist kitchenware company, employing over 600 colleagues, and operating from its Store Support Centre in Gloucester."]},{"type":"p","children":["As a B Corp, a Real Living Wage employer and a certified Great Place to WorkTM, ProCook is committ